      {
        "_key": "t302c",
        "_type": "tldrBox",
        "items": [
          "A hospital website and a private-practice website are **different products** with different budgets.",
          "**Solo practice:** a landing page from £800 · **Clinic:** a full site from £3,500 · **Hospital/group:** from £12,000",
          "The classic mistake: buying \"room to grow\" you won't use — or a brochure where you needed a system",
          "The architecture scales: starting small and growing is a normal path"
        ],
        "title": "In 60 seconds"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t302d",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t302e",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Why \"a medical website\" is three different jobs"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t302f",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t302g",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A solo dentist, a 10-practitioner clinic and a hospital with departments all ask for \"a website\" — but mean three different tools. A practice needs to be found and booked. A clinic needs to route patients across services and practitioners. A hospital needs to carry departmental structure, schedules and load. Buy the wrong format and you either overpay for the unused — or hit the ceiling in six months."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t302h",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t302i",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A solo practice: a landing page from £800"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t302j",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t302k",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "One practitioner, a few services, one patient flow. A landing page is enough: who you are, what you treat, prices, reviews, a booking form. No CMS or directory — there's nothing to fill them with. It's the fastest start: 1–2 weeks and you can be found and booked. When a second practitioner and a dozen services arrive, you grow into a full site without a rebuild."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t302l",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t302m",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A clinic: a full website from £3,500"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t302n",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t302o",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Several practitioners, dozens of services, two or three arms. A system works here: a page per service (your SEO entry points), a practitioner directory with schedules, online booking integrated with your practice system, a CMS-managed price list. The extended format from £6,500 adds a blog, insurance integration and a clinic CRM."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t302p",
        "_type": "blogImage",
        "alt": "A clinician with a smartphone at a clinic",
        "asset": {
          "_ref": "image-289eed171553ffa71d101c3871d24a1b8bd2eff1-1600x1067-jpg",
          "_type": "reference"
        },
        "caption": "Patients book from their phones — your website's format should match the size of the practice, not the ambition"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t302q",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t302r",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A hospital or group: from £12,000"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t302s",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t302t",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A multi-location structure: each site has its own practitioners, schedules and phones under one brand and standard. Add complex integrations (EPR, labs), multilingual support and an SLA. This isn't \"a website\" anymore — it's infrastructure, and it's designed accordingly, starting with an architectural session."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
